pression ratio. This is part of \"am-utils\" suite.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m7zip\u001b[0m : 7-Zip is a file archiver with a high compression ratio.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m86box\u001b[0m : Emulator of x86-based machines based on PCem.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m86box-enhanced\u001b[0m : Unofficial, emulator of x86-based machines based on PCem.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m9launcher\u001b[0m : An actively maintained"]
