[0.212, "o", "\r\u001b[K ◆ \u001b[32maffine\u001b[0m : Next-gen knowledge base that brings planning, sorting and creating.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32maffinity\u001b[0m : Affinity is a suite of professional graphic design, photo editing, and desktop publishing software. It's a common alternative to software \r\n   from the Adobe Suite such as for Adobe Photoshop, Adobe Illustrator, Adobe InDesign.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32magregore\u001b[0m : A minimal browser for the distributed web, Desktop version.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32mahk_x11\u001b[0m : AutoHotkey for Linux (X11-based systems).\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32mai-bot-workspace\u001b[0m : Electron app including testing workspaces.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32maichat\u001b[0m : AIO AI CLI tool integrating 20+ AI platforms, including OpenAI.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32maidm\u001b[0m : AppImage Desktop Maker.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32maillio-ts\u001b[0m : The desktop application for Aillio Bullet R1.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32maim\u001b[0m : A command line download/upload tool with resume.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32mair-controller-desktop\u001b[0m : Android phone assistant,powered by Flutter.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32mairspaces\u001b[0m : An online map for your X-Plane flight sessions.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32maisap\u001b[0m : Tool to make sandboxing AppImages easy through bwrap/bubblewrap.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32maisleriot\u001b[0m : Unofficial. A card game featuring over 80 different solitaire-type card games.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32makasha\u001b[0m : AKASHA community client.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32makhenaten\u001b[0m : Unofficial, open-source engine for Pharaoh (+Cleopatra) city-building game.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32makuse\u001b[0m : Simple and easy to use anime streaming desktop app without ads.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32malacritty\u001b[0m : Unofficial. A modern terminal emulator that comes with sensible defaults, but allows for extensive configuration.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32malbafetch\u001b[0m : CLI, faster neofetch alternative, written in C. Still improving.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32malduin\u001b[0m : An Atom and RSS feed aggregator.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32malephium-wallet\u001b[0m : The official Alephium wallet for desktop.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32malexandria\u001b[0m : eBook reader built with Tauri, Epub.js, and Typescript.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32malien-tec-ui\u001b[0m : Alien-Tec Tron Matrix Like Shell Terminal User Interface.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32mallusion\u001b[0m : A desktop application for managing your visual library.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32malma\u001b[0m : Elegant AI Provider Orchestration. A beautiful desktop application that unifies your AI experience. Seamlessly switch between OpenAI, Anthropic, \r\n   Google Gemini, and custom providers.\r\n   \r\n:\u001b[K"]
