[0.010, "o", " LIST OF THE 2817 APPIMAGES AVAILABLE IN THE \"AM\" DATABASE:\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m0ad\u001b[0m : FOSS historical Real Time Strategy, RTS game of ancient warfare.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m0ad-prerelease\u001b[0m : FOSS historical Real Time Strategy, RTS game of ancient warfare (Pre-release).\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m12to11\u001b[0m : Unofficial, tool for running Wayland applications on an X server.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m3d-puzzles\u001b[0m : 3D-Puzzles are Rubik, Dogic and Dogic12.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m3nity-media\u001b[0m : Cross-platform media player built with Lazarus/Free Pascal and libmpv. Features playlist management, internet radio, equalizer, \r\n   visualizations, stream recording, and 100 language translations.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m432hz-player\u001b[0m : Because most music is recorded in 440hz, Audio Player.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m5ire\u001b[0m : 5ire is a cross-platform desktop AI assistant, MCP client. It compatible with major service providers, supports local knowledge base and tools \r\n   via model context protocol servers.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m86box\u001b[0m : Emulator of x86-based machines based on PCem.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m86box-enhanced\u001b[0m : Unofficial, emulator of x86-based machines based on PCem.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32m9launcher\u001b[0m : An actively maintained and cross platform remake of Touhou Relauncher.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32maaaaxy\u001b[0m : A nonlinear puzzle platformer, game.\r\n   \r\n ◆ \u001b[32mabaddon\u001b[0m : Unofficial, an alternative Discord client with voice support made with C++ and GTK 3.\r\n   \r\n:\u001b[K"]
